    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8489" root="حفر" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْفُورٌ</span></b>  [<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفِيرٌ</span> as meaning <i>Dug:</i> see the
latter.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَمُ فُلَانٍ مَحْفُورٌ</span> [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْنَانُهُ مَحْفُورَةٌ</span>]
(tropical:)  <i>The teeth of such a one are affected with what
is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفْرٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفَرٌ</span>. (S, TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَبِىٌّ مَحْفُورٌ</span>
(assumed tropical:)  <i>A child having a pimple,</i> or <i>small pustule, in the
gum.</i> (El-Wá'ee.)

